<title>HUNGARY: Hungarian O/N rates end a shade easier.</title>
<headline>Hungarian O/N rates end a shade easier.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates finished slightly easier on Tuesday at 20.625/20.75 percent, as compared to Monday's close of 20.75/21.00 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>They described trading on the second day of bank's two-week reserve period as routine with plenty of liquidity and said they expected little change over the next few days.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
